  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Educate the most disadvantaged children(EMDC) International Climate Fund through BRAC.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is a specific component for International Climate Finance (ICF) fund under The Educate the Most Disadvantaged Children (EMDC) programme through BRAC. The objective of this component is to increase awareness of teacher, student and management committee members on climate change risk and adaptation. This EMDC-B programme is focusing on most disadvantaged out of school children in different geographical pockets including some climate vulnerable areas.</narrative>
  </description>
